{
  "title": "Your phone shoots cinema (TOFU)",
  "caption": "Your phone shoots cinema. You're just not using it. 🎬\n\n7 fixes that make your content look expensive. No new gear required (ok, maybe a $20 mic).\n\nSave this for your next shoot.\n\n#contentcreation #videotips #iphonevideo #personalbrand #creativeminds",
  "slides": [
    {
      "text": "Your phone shoots cinema. You're just not using it.\n\n7 fixes that make your content look expensive.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "camera",
          "width": 400,
          "rotate": -2,
          "lighting": "overhead",
          "background": "wall",
          "framing": "center",
          "ink": [
            {
              "type": "circle",
              "target": "light",
              "pad": 4,
              "label": "?",
              "labelSize": 56
            },
            {
              "type": "circle",
              "target": "eyes",
              "pad": 18,
              "label": "?",
              "labelSize": 56
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "this costs\nyou views.",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 300,
              "rotate": -5,
              "size": 57
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**1. Kill the overheads.**\n\nTurn off ceiling lights. They flatten your face and make every video look like a Zoom call.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "camera",
          "width": 400,
          "rotate": 1.5,
          "lighting": "overhead",
          "background": "wall",
          "framing": "thirds",
          "ink": [
            {
              "type": "circle",
              "target": "light",
              "pad": 6
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "turn these\nOFF.",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 40,
              "rotate": -5,
              "size": 60,
              "arrowTo": "light"
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "raccoon\neyes",
              "x": -300,
              "y": 230,
              "rotate": 4,
              "size": 55,
              "arrowTo": "eyes"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**2. Light from the side, not the front.**\n\nSit 45 degrees to a window. Shadow on one side of your face equals depth.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "camera",
          "width": 400,
          "rotate": -1.5,
          "lighting": "side",
          "background": "deep",
          "framing": "thirds",
          "ink": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "window\n@ 45°",
              "x": -300,
              "y": 120,
              "rotate": -4,
              "size": 57,
              "arrowTo": "window"
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "shadow\n= depth",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 240,
              "rotate": 4,
              "size": 57,
              "arrowTo": "face"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**3. Pull away from the wall.**\n\nPut 6+ feet between you and the background. Instant separation, instant production value.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "camera",
          "width": 400,
          "rotate": 1.5,
          "lighting": "side",
          "background": "deep",
          "framing": "thirds",
          "ink": [
            {
              "type": "circle",
              "target": "bokeh",
              "pad": -30
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "6+ feet\nback here",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 120,
              "rotate": -5,
              "size": 60,
              "arrowTo": "bokeh"
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "soft blur\n= $$$",
              "x": -300,
              "y": 420,
              "rotate": 4,
              "size": 55
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**4. Lock your exposure.**\n\nTap and hold. Stop your phone from pulsing brighter and darker mid-sentence.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "camera",
          "width": 400,
          "rotate": -1.5,
          "lighting": "soft",
          "background": "deep",
          "framing": "thirds",
          "aeLock": true,
          "exposurePulse": true,
          "ink": [
            {
              "type": "circle",
              "target": "aelock",
              "pad": 8
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "tap + hold\nuntil you\nsee this",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 40,
              "rotate": -5,
              "size": 55,
              "arrowTo": "aelock"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**5. Frame off-center.**\n\nEyes on the top third, a little space in the direction you're facing. Dead center reads amateur.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "camera",
          "width": 400,
          "rotate": 1.5,
          "lighting": "side",
          "background": "deep",
          "framing": "thirds",
          "grid": true,
          "ink": [
            {
              "type": "circle",
              "target": "eyes",
              "pad": 14
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "eyes on\nthis line",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 150,
              "rotate": -5,
              "size": 57,
              "arrowTo": "eyes"
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "room to\nbreathe →",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 420,
              "rotate": 3,
              "size": 52
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**6. Audio is half the picture.**\n\nA $20 lav mic beats a $2,000 camera with bad sound. People forgive ugly video. They scroll past bad audio.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "camera",
          "width": 400,
          "rotate": -1.5,
          "lighting": "side",
          "background": "deep",
          "framing": "thirds",
          "meter": "clipping",
          "ink": [
            {
              "type": "circle",
              "target": "meter",
              "pad": 6
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "clipping =\ninstant\nscroll",
              "x": -300,
              "y": 120,
              "rotate": 4,
              "size": 55,
              "arrowTo": "meter"
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "$20 lav\nfixes it.",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 330,
              "rotate": -5,
              "size": 57
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**7. Respect the UI.**\n\nKeep text and faces out of the bottom and right edges. If the like button covers your caption, the platform wins.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "camera",
          "width": 400,
          "rotate": 1.5,
          "lighting": "side",
          "background": "deep",
          "framing": "thirds",
          "reels": true,
          "reelsCaption": "3 LIGHTING TIPS YOU NEED",
          "ink": [
            {
              "type": "box",
              "target": "safe",
              "pad": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "cross",
              "target": "reels-caption",
              "pad": 4
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "safe zone",
              "x": -300,
              "y": 150,
              "rotate": -4,
              "size": 57,
              "arrowTo": "safe"
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "text": "buried.",
              "x": 440,
              "y": 470,
              "rotate": 4,
              "size": 57,
              "arrowTo": "reels-caption"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Save this for your next shoot.",
      "graphic": {
        "type": "shot",
        "props": {
          "kind": "notes",
          "rotate": -1.2,
          "width": 720,
          "title": "Shoot checklist",
          "items": [
